  "body": "We should rename the \"extract-value flag\" for [collect-an-http-quoted-string](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#collect-an-http-quoted-string) to \"extract-value\" and define it as a boolean. This would likely require changes to MIME Sniffing and Server Timing as well.\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @annevk in https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/1566#issuecomment-1345477692_\r\n      ",
